    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b61f2ac13836524bc712a9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了追寻梦想而决心移籍到我的队伍，\n她在这里终于描绘出了梦想的形状。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1226f59aa1966a3ed31040477056941da214feb75c5418aaf7c5b970bf8784c8",
