      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她采取的速度仿佛把终点线看作近在眼前一样，\n但终点线却在极远处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24d575e7ea65bf9d9f8790a1bec6de25f99b549f7232bed14196e1dbfa1ac8d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
