      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『宝冢纪念』上她会看到怎样的“景色”，\n又会让我看到怎样的“景色”呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "033e3426f15fbc95a4f3c39be718951442dba64091e6118525083d0416290725",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
